<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rate rises, week narrows.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rate rises, week narrows.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a short private sector market on Sunday to between 9 7/8 and 10 1/2 percent from Thursday's range of 9 3/4 and 10 3/8 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>The bankers said one-week rates narrowed slightly to between 10 and 10 7/16 against 10 and 10 1/2 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
